# Always ship

When work is done, ship it. Do not wait for "ship" or "build and ship".

1. Commit on `ui/market-ticker-black`.
2. Push, open a PR, merge with `gh pr merge --merge` into `main` so Render deploys `https://factfinder-85w9.onrender.com/`.
3. Never force-push `main`. Never skip hooks unless asked. Do not commit secrets.

Keep the commit message to 1-2 sentences on the why.
